OL,3,CDetails of PM Andy Burnham's meetings
OL,4,Cwith Man City released
OL,6,FAndy Burnham had a formal meeting with
OL,7,FManchester City's chairman at an
OL,8,Finvestment summit, chatted to him in
OL,9,Fthe stands at a star player's
OL,10,Ftestimonial game and was accompanied
OL,11,Fby staff from the club on official
OL,12,Foverseas visits.
OL,14,FDetails of the prime minister's
OL,15,Fcontacts with the scandal-hit club and
OL,16,Fits Abu Dhabi owners - including
OL,17,FKhaldoon Al Mubarak - during his time
OL,18,Fas Greater Manchester Mayor were
OL,19,Freleased by the combined authority.
