OL,3,CDetails of PM Andy Burnham's meetings
OL,4,Cwith Man City released
OL,6,FIt comes as Burnham told MPs that "all
OL,7,Fof my dealings" with Manchester City's
OL,8,Fowners would be published.
OL,10,FA Greater Manchester Combined
OL,11,FAuthority spokesman said: "In October
OL,12,F2021 Andy Burnham, in his role as
OL,13,Fmayor of Greater Manchester, had a
OL,14,Fformal meeting with Khaldoon Al
OL,15,FMubarak at the UK Government's Global
OL,16,FInvestment Summit arranged by the
OL,17,FDepartment for International Trade.
OL,26,@nD@cOUoD@OO]sD@[OU
