OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F305A1791915546
OL,3,CDetails of PM Andy Burnham's meetings
OL,4,Cwith Man City released
OL,6,F"In his capacity as mayor, he was a
OL,7,Fguest of Manchester City FC at home
OL,8,Fmatches on a small number of
OL,9,Foccasions, including attending Vincent
OL,10,FKompany's testimonial match in
OL,11,FSeptember 2019, where he met the
OL,12,Fchairman informally in the stands.
OL,13,FThese have been declared in the usual
OL,14,Fway.
OL,16,F"Also during his time as mayor,
OL,17,Frepresentatives of Greater Manchester
OL,18,Fsporting clubs would routinely join
OL,19,Fbusiness delegations as part of
OL,20,Fmayoral international visits.
OL,26,@nD@AOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/5
