OL,3,CDetails of PM Andy Burnham's meetings
OL,4,Cwith Man City released
OL,6,F"This included representatives from
OL,7,FManchester United travelling to Austin
OL,8,Fand Dublin, Lancashire Cricket Club
OL,9,Fjoining a delegation to India, and
OL,10,FManchester City FC staff supporting
OL,11,Fvisits to China and Japan."
OL,13,FCity have been found guilty of
OL,14,Fbreaching Premier League financial
OL,15,Fregulations between 2009 and 2018.
OL,17,FThe club maintained their innocence
OL,18,Fand appealed against the verdict.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@[O]
