OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F305A1791915546
OL,3,CDetails of PM Andy Burnham's meetings
OL,4,Cwith Man City released
OL,6,FBurnham said in September he would be
OL,7,F"really concerned" if City's Abu Dhabi
OL,8,Fowners sold the club in the wake of
OL,9,Fthe finding, crediting them with being
OL,10,F"a huge partner in the building of
OL,11,Fmodern Manchester".
OL,13,FDowning Street sought to clarify his
OL,14,Fcomments afterwards, saying the prime
OL,15,Fminister was clear the judgment is
OL,16,Fserious and that where wrongdoing is
OL,17,Festablished, those responsible should
OL,18,Fface the consequences.
